Package: iQualityR.msa
Title: Measurement System Analysis for iQualityR
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Provides comprehensive measurement system analysis (MSA) tools
    following the AIAG MSA 4th edition and VDA 5 standards. Implements
    Type 1 gage studies with Cg/Cgk capability indices, gage linearity
    and bias studies, crossed and nested Gage R&R studies via the ANOVA
    and Xbar-R methods, attribute agreement analysis with Cohen/Fleiss
    kappa, the Wagner two-way method, and detection probability analysis.
    Designed to align with the analysis workflow and output layout of
    Minitab while integrating with the iQualityR ecosystem.
